",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1],[null,"I have created a simple, tactile counter web page featuring a prominent, push-button interface:

- **Large Tactile Button**: A central 3D mechanical-style push button with responsive press states, haptic feedback, and floating "+1" particle animations.
